## Symlinks (product id in filename)

Parser: `scripts/gold_set/raw_cam_id.py` — requires **P-code in symlink name**, not `cam-N`.

```bash
MATCH="/home/catch/Documents/Matches/Match 4"
cd "$MATCH"
ln -sf cam-3_cam-3_LIVE_20260819-143755.mp4   P1-match4.mp4
ln -sf cam-6_cam-6_LIVE_20260819-143755.mp4   P6-match4.mp4
ln -sf cam-11_cam-11_LIVE_20260819-143755.mp4 P7-match4.mp4
